    "field": "Polar atmospheric circulation",
    "problem": "Manifestations of polar climate change related to atmospheric circulation are less understood than temperature-related aspects, making it challenging to separate human-forced trends from internal atmospheric variability and project future changes.",
    "method": "This paper reviews and synthesizes recent progress in understanding observed and projected changes in polar atmospheric circulation by analyzing findings from existing climate model projections, reanalysis data, and observational studies.",
    "task": "The task is to review recent progress in understanding the causes of observed changes in polar atmospheric circulation and in interpreting climate model projections of their future changes.",
