            "paragraph": "Arctic cyclone characteristics are correlated with key large-scale atmospheric indices, such as El Ni\u00f1o Southern Oscillation (ENSO) and NAM; however, these associations vary with season and none alone sufficiently explains cyclone variability or trends [58, 61].",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
