            "paragraph": "Regionally, changes in the depth and location of the ASL have a major impact on the climate of West Antarctica [119, 120] and it is therefore important in the broader context of understanding observed trends in regional sea ice and West Antarctic ice sheet mass balance [121].",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
